      "writtenOn": "2016-04-06T20:44:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there should be no need for a json package. Keystone only supports json so there isn\u0027t going to be another one.\n\nAlso, having long import lines is one of the reasons we shouldn\u0027t have keystone_ in the package name.",
      "revId": "ac2391aac6abc6060bb10545f379e673f8224ccb",
